    "detailed_description": "<h1>Game based on a series of bestselling books</h1><p></p><br><h1>Check out more games</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1898910/extras/b3988d13cbed14b847016458a4285425.avif?t=1706778275\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1898910/extras/a13c9894647b36c537956deaeab2d293.avif?t=1706778275\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1898910/extras/10f4702e2ccf997eac233a51e6fcc849.avif?t=1706778275\" /></div><br><br>A game based on the bestselling book series by Kayla Stone. A gripping post-apocalyptic thriller. Experience the story from the books in a new installment.<br><br>During one of Michigan's cold winters, an EMP attack occurs, causing a power outage. Cars, phones, and other amenities are out of service.<br><br>Thanks to the EMP, Hannah Sheridan imprisoned for the past five years in a psychopath's basement can finally get out. At the edge of her mental and physical endurance and pregnant, Hannah tries to make her way through miles of freezing forest. She is determined to reach her family.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Survive</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1898910/extras/431effa307d81fdd1a10a45d23e5b5de.poster.avif?t=1706778275\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1898910/extras/431effa307d81fdd1a10a45d23e5b5de.webm?t=1706778275\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1898910/extras/431effa307d81fdd1a10a45d23e5b5de.mp4?t=1706778275\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Look after food and fresh water and be prepared with limited equipment. Get plenty of sleep and watch the temperature. Cold and dark nights are not pleasant. Watch over your heroine's mental health. Avoid or confront danger with stealth and turn-based combat<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Combat</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1898910/extras/f506c976a571806b6b82f9263f8fe2ff.poster.avif?t=1706778275\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1898910/extras/f506c976a571806b6b82f9263f8fe2ff.webm?t=1706778275\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1898910/extras/f506c976a571806b6b82f9263f8fe2ff.mp4?t=1706778275\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Avoid danger by sneaking behind enemy's backs or face them in turn-based battles. Use the terrain to your advantage and utilise each character's abilities.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Build relationships</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1898910/extras/d2fcc3bb3892762fc4044594ad65c345.poster.avif?t=1706778275\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1898910/extras/d2fcc3bb3892762fc4044594ad65c345.webm?t=1706778275\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1898910/extras/d2fcc3bb3892762fc4044594ad65c345.mp4?t=1706778275\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Talk to your companions and sing melancholic songs around the campfire. Hug and care for your dog to increase their affection.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Mechanics of changing temperature and weather. The player must take care to conserve heat appropriately.<br></li><li>Crafting items from limited resources. It is not possible to make everything.<br></li><li>Extensive relationship system between companions.<br></li><li>Unique development trees for each character.<br></li><li>Struggling with the main character's overblown psyche.<br></li><li>Dangerous frozen lakes, frosty cliffs and caves.<br></li><li>A gripping and poignant story.<br></li><li>A realistic post-apocalypse without any zombies or mutants.<br></li><li>Each character has unique abilities allowing them to obtain items in different ways and enter places inaccessible to others.</li></ul><br>",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1898910/extras/b3988d13cbed14b847016458a4285425.avif?t=1706778275\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1898910/extras/a13c9894647b36c537956deaeab2d293.avif?t=1706778275\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1898910/extras/10f4702e2ccf997eac233a51e6fcc849.avif?t=1706778275\" /></div><br><br>A game based on the bestselling book series by Kayla Stone. A gripping post-apocalyptic thriller. Experience the story from the books in a new installment.<br><br>During one of Michigan's cold winters, an EMP attack occurs, causing a power outage. Cars, phones, and other amenities are out of service.<br><br>Thanks to the EMP, Hannah Sheridan imprisoned for the past five years in a psychopath's basement can finally get out. At the edge of her mental and physical endurance and pregnant, Hannah tries to make her way through miles of freezing forest. She is determined to reach her family.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Survive</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1898910/extras/431effa307d81fdd1a10a45d23e5b5de.poster.avif?t=1706778275\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1898910/extras/431effa307d81fdd1a10a45d23e5b5de.webm?t=1706778275\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1898910/extras/431effa307d81fdd1a10a45d23e5b5de.mp4?t=1706778275\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Look after food and fresh water and be prepared with limited equipment. Get plenty of sleep and watch the temperature. Cold and dark nights are not pleasant. Watch over your heroine's mental health. Avoid or confront danger with stealth and turn-based combat<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Combat</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1898910/extras/f506c976a571806b6b82f9263f8fe2ff.poster.avif?t=1706778275\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1898910/extras/f506c976a571806b6b82f9263f8fe2ff.webm?t=1706778275\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1898910/extras/f506c976a571806b6b82f9263f8fe2ff.mp4?t=1706778275\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Avoid danger by sneaking behind enemy's backs or face them in turn-based battles. Use the terrain to your advantage and utilise each character's abilities.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Build relationships</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1898910/extras/d2fcc3bb3892762fc4044594ad65c345.poster.avif?t=1706778275\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1898910/extras/d2fcc3bb3892762fc4044594ad65c345.webm?t=1706778275\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1898910/extras/d2fcc3bb3892762fc4044594ad65c345.mp4?t=1706778275\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Talk to your companions and sing melancholic songs around the campfire. Hug and care for your dog to increase their affection.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Mechanics of changing temperature and weather. The player must take care to conserve heat appropriately.<br></li><li>Crafting items from limited resources. It is not possible to make everything.<br></li><li>Extensive relationship system between companions.<br></li><li>Unique development trees for each character.<br></li><li>Struggling with the main character's overblown psyche.<br></li><li>Dangerous frozen lakes, frosty cliffs and caves.<br></li><li>A gripping and poignant story.<br></li><li>A realistic post-apocalypse without any zombies or mutants.<br></li><li>Each character has unique abilities allowing them to obtain items in different ways and enter places inaccessible to others.</li></ul><br>",
    "short_description": "In the dead of winter, an EMP attack destroys the US power grid. For Hannah, however, it\u2019s the best day in 5 years. She was imprisoned in a psycho's basement - explosion releases the lock of her prison. Now she can begin the search for her family while feeling the breath of her abuser on her neck.",
